cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If TANGO contributes to your work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "TANGO: Techno-economic ANalysis of Geoenergy Operations"
abstract: >-
  Techno-economic ANalysis of Geoenergy Operations. TANGO couples
  reservoir, wells, and surface plant in one modular simulator, solves them
  over the project's lifetime, and computes the levelized cost of
  electricity or heat.
authors:
  - name: "Geothermal Energy and Geofluids Group, Department of Earth and Planetary Sciences, ETH Zürich"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-24
repository-code: "https://github.com/GEG-ETHZ/TANGO-core"
keywords:
  - geothermal energy
  - techno-economic analysis
  - LCOE
  - reservoir simulation
  - well modeling
  - surface plant
